a complete delivery schedule;
milestone-based payments through the platform;
full delivery of source code, repositories, credentials, documentation and intellectual property to NEVIE-GLOBAL;
no vendor lock-in.

Proposals exceeding the target budget may only be considered if the additional cost is clearly and precisely justified.

